<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopian birr weakens against the dollar.</title>
<headline>Ethiopian birr weakens against the dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ethiopian birr weakened against the dollar on Monday, the central bank, the National Bank of Ethiopia (NBE), said.</p>
<p>It posted the birr at mean rate of 6.4970 against the dollar compared to 6.4730 on Friday. Against the pound, the birr was posted at a mean rate of 0.6031 from 10.5768 on Friday.</p>
</text>
